      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for catching this. I initially thought the flags were dedup by `args.add_all` in Starlark. Turned out it was because I used a set https://android.googlesource.com/platform/build/bazel/+/refs/changes/39/2768339/8/toolchains/rust/flags.bzl#29. I reverted using the set data structure and these spaces don\u0027t need to be removed anymore except for [`--color always`](https://android.googlesource.com/platform/build/soong/+/refs/changes/07/2758107/5/rust/config/global.go#55) because in Bazel, we need to remove it to avoid flag duplication in rustc command.",
